# Wave W17-Z (Route 216): bridge pine — a snow pine at the road’s edges under the heaviest load of the three snow pines: deep teal tiers mostly buried in settled snow, the green showing at the tier edges, on pack turf (ground baked in). Route 216’s own tree — split from Route 217’s bench pine by load entire (bridge snow sits deeper) and from Lake Insight’s bank fir by colour: this pine is teal under snow, that one is blue-green.
